Lines 143-144:
  const start = slotStartTime.hour() * 60 + slotStartTime.minute();
  const end = slotStartTime.hour() * 60 + slotStartTime.minute();

Both use slotStartTime. The `end` variable should use slotEndTime instead.

Line 114:
  if (dayjs(date.start).add(utcOffset, "minutes") === dayjs(date.end).add(utcOffset, "minutes")) {
    return true;
  }

This uses === reference comparison on two distinct Dayjs objects, which always evaluates to false.
